    "name": "Truto Unified HRIS Employees API",
    "description": "The Truto Unified HRIS API provides a single normalized interface for reading and writing HR data across 41 HRIS providers including BambooHR, Workday, Rippling, Gusto, HiBob, Personio, Oracle Fusion Cloud HCM, and more. All data is accessed in real-time with no caching. Includes 20 unified resources. Schema can be extended using JSONata mappings.",
